https://drive.google.com/file/d/1r3dkWhRu1tt27wubC66RTahD_hDGsY_F/view?usp=sharing

**Impact:**

- Full 2FA bypass and account takeover, given only valid credentials up to the OTP step.
- No dependence on exhaustive brute force — the vulnerability effectively shrinks the guess space by keeping an unbounded number of past codes alive.
- Fully automatable and scriptable at scale.
